# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DENY-LIST — this repo is PUBLIC.
# Deny by default is deliberate: leaking a secret should require actively
# defeating this file, not merely forgetting to add something.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# keys & certificates
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
*.gpg
*.asc
known_hosts

# credential stores
.netrc
rclone.conf
hosts.yml
credentials
.npmrc
.pypirc
.docker/config.json
.claude.json
*.1pux
.aws/
.gnupg/
.ssh/

# machine-local / secret-bearing overrides (see secrets.example/)
local.sh
secrets.env
*.local

# environments
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# GTK file-chooser state — machine-local, and it names home-dir layout,
# internal hostnames and remote usernames. Lives in $HOME and in backups only.
**/gtk-3.0/bookmarks
**/gtk-3.0/servers

# noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# token files (polybar github notifier etc.) — value lives outside git,
# referenced from configs via ${file:~/.config/polybar/github.token}
*.token
github.token
